    <briefdescription>
<para>A line segment templated on the dimension. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Like the underlying algebra::VectorD data, is not initialized when the default constructor is used. Since it is a small class, it is designed to be allocated on the stack and to be passed by value (or const &amp;).</para>
<para>The class should be named SegmentD, but it is a demonstration.</para>
